'''Tyrandas''', also known as the '''Isle of Tyrandas''',<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|54+|The Light of Elunaris}}</ref> is an island located to the northeast of [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. Once home to a sacred temple of the [[Sisterhood of Elune]], the [[Temple of Elunaris]] has long since been abandoned by the Sisterhood.<ref>[[Talanis Amberscribe#Quotes]]</ref> One of the two druidic circles of Moonwhisper Coast, the [[Grove of the Sun]], can be found on the island.

